    <innerclass refid="classONNX__LIGHT__NAMESPACE_1_1ScopeExit" prot="public">ONNX_LIGHT_NAMESPACE::ScopeExit</innerclass>
    <innernamespace refid="namespaceONNX__LIGHT__NAMESPACE">ONNX_LIGHT_NAMESPACE</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII helpers for OS-level resources and scope-exit guards. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides three utilities:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>ScopedResource – a non-copyable RAII wrapper that calls a user-supplied <computeroutput>Close</computeroutput> function when the held value leaves scope.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ScopedFd / ScopedHandle – ready-made specialisations for POSIX file descriptors and Win32 HANDLE values, respectively.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ScopeExit – a non-copyable guard that invokes a callable when it is destroyed, regardless of how the enclosing scope is exited. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
